{
  "slug": "jaequery-s-claude-skills-and-agents",
  "name": "Jaequery S Claude Skills And Agents",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "My personal Claude Code arsenal, custom slash-command skills and a curated roster of 140+ specialist subagents, published as a single Claude Code plugin marketplace. Built to turn Claude from a clever assistant into an opinionated team of domain experts.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **17 skills** and **16 agents**.\n\n- **Skills** (17): `cmux-diff` (Start cmux-diff (VSCode-style changes panel) to view changed files and diffs in a sidebar layout), `code-review` (Surgical, evidence-gated code review across Simple, Performant, Clean, Secure, and Testable dimensions), `dda` (Deep Dive Analysis — perform an in-depth review of a plan, assemble an optimal team of specialized Claude…), `git-audit` (Audit a git repository's health, history, and team dynamics), `market-research` (Scrape Google Autocomplete, Reddit, YouTube, and Google Trends for keyword opportunities around any topic), `marketing-reddit` (Find relevant Reddit posts, leave comments on them, or create new threads/posts), `next-feature` (Plan the single most useful next feature to add to the current project), `orchestrate` (Run a tournament-style multi-agent decision or build), and 9 more\n- **Agents** (16): `design`, `engineering`, `examples`, `game-development`, `integrations`, `marketing`, `paid-media`, `product`, and 8 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install jaequery-s-claude-skills-and-agents@claude-community` from `jaequery/dot-claude`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 17,
    "agent": 16
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
  "author": {
    "name": "Jae Lee",
